{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Coco Bean is a big baby sweetheart. She prefers calm environments with someone and is quite interactive! Curious Coco likes to roam around and stick her nose into whatever you may be doing (but mostly into paper bags and cardboard boxes). She loves to play, chasing the jumpy ball wand cat toy every which way, and showing off her reflexes by catching small toys and bits of paper! Once in a while, she gets the zoomies and does parkour at 1 am. Coco's love for pets and quality nap time may be greater than her love for playful exercise - she likes to both stretch and curl up to sleep in a quiet spot near (or maybe on!) you. Coco is affectionate, communicates through slow blinks and occasional meowing, and appreciates cuddles and naps.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=18&searchType=4&animalid=210376","id":"52f86c9eaf5c012c7c7724112b2514b8","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/4d8c2edf48d9419d943dc764719d8f20-1794780846-1794780891-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/88743d8fe3094d1b9b4d93f3c97a18ee-1794780846-1794780875-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/fe46749cbd4346bcb1944f09b8da6cc4-1794780844-1794780850-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6d2d0c17e0d948f190b746b70a389d08-1794780846-1794780846-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ade6cd1f0da149acb7b14d8564b1b564-1794780846-1794780846-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/23b51ee9a3404d48ba8abc01ac8ca0c9-1794780845-1794780845-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/ef67622425c044baa6a1f58d69336f36